@startuml link_recovery
!theme cyborg
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif
skinparam backgroundColor #0b1018
skinparam defaultFontColor #e6edf7
skinparam ArrowColor #a9b8ca
title L2_COMMUNICATION link recovery boundary
start
:Detect lost station link;
:Wait for CONTROL's Idle network lease;
:Ask WIFI to reconnect to the saved network;
if (Selected-network address available?) then (yes)
 :Publish connected outcome;
else (recovery exhausted)
 :Report cause; enter provisioning in Idle;
 :Scan through WIFI; start hotspot and PORTAL;
endif
:Release work to CONTROL;
stop
note right
 Listening interrupts active recovery through safe teardown.
 WIFI performs operations; COMMUNICATION decides recovery.
 Retry budgets and re-entry policy belong to detailed design.
end note
@enduml
